--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/playwright-ci-runbook.md
@@ -0,0 +1,55 @@
+# Playwright CI Runbook
+
+## Stages
+
+### lint
+Shellcheck and shfmt on all shell scripts in the repository.
+
+### test-unit
+Three parallel groups:
+
+| Group | Scope |
+|---|---|
+| test-checks | Shell unit tests in `pi/tests/` and `tests/playwright/evidence/` |
+| test-ci-generator | CI manifest validation + generator roundtrip |
+| test-playwright-bootstrap | Headless project load without browser (`tests/playwright/runner/bootstrap.spec.ts`) |
+| test-playwright-headed-contract | Headed contract tests (platform self-tests, evidence, result semantics) |
+| test-playwright-platform | Platform tests via `npm run test:platform` (platform/ evidence/ runner/) |
+| test-playwright-service | Service tests via `npm run test:service` (services/audiobookshelf/) |
+
+### report
+Aggregates lint and test-unit results into a CI summary artifact.
+
+### post-deploy (main branch only)
+Runs after deployment to a live environment:
+
+1. **smoke-audiobookshelf** — Executes `tests/playwright/ci/post-deploy.sh` which delegates to `run.sh service`. Runs all service-level Playwright tests (authenticated smoke, library/playback, authorization) against the deployed instance.
+
+## Test Counts (current)
+- provisioning: 31
+- shared fixtures: 10
+- OIDC: 7
+- smoke: 5
+- **total: 53**
+
+## CI wrapper scripts
+
+| Script | Purpose |
+|---|---|
+| `tests/playwright/runner/run.sh` | Ephemeral Docker runner for platform & service tests |
+| `tests/playwright/ci/post-deploy.sh` | Post-deployment smoke wrapper (delegates to run.sh) |
+
+## Runner modes
+
+| Command | What it runs |
+|---|---|
+| `run.sh platform` | `npm run test:platform` — platform/ evidence/ runner/ tests |
+| `run.sh service` | `npm run test:service` — services/audiobookshelf/ tests |
+| `run.sh service:<url>` | Prerequisite checks + `npm run test:service` against live URL |
+
+## Adding a new test
+
+1. Place platform tests in `tests/playwright/platform/`
+2. Place service tests in `tests/playwright/services/<service>/`
+3. Platform tests are auto-included by `test:platform` (testDir: platform/ evidence/ runner/)
+4. Service tests are auto-included by `test:service` (testDir: services/)
